 - tests/tools/fault_stress.ps1 -Runs n -Parallel p: runs the fault tests n times in each of p parallel loops (20 s timeout per run), prints `runs= hangs= failures=`, non-zero on any hang or failure. Not in any tier; needs minutes. The fault filter writes dumps through out/bin/astroray_dump.exe (src/dump/main.cpp), staged beside astroray_core.dll.
 - perf.ps1 [-Record] [-MeasureTolerance] [-Shares]: bench b1m and b5m under one lock hold, `pass_ms` against the last bench/history line of this machine (limit B-38, decision table in perf.py), refuses while another process uses the GPU; `land prepare` runs it for kernel, device, scheduler, session and scene diffs. -Record appends the lines to bench/history (lead). -Shares: nsys captures of b1m and b5m, idle and queue_build+sort shares (perf_shares.py, B-19 tolerance in budgets.toml); land prepare runs it for scheduler, queue_build, sort and CUDA-device diffs.
