 - sync_timing.ps1 [-Runs 3] [-History] [-Profile]: B-31's four cells (full mesh read, positions only, instance loop, plain move; cold and warm) on S1 = b1m and S2 = b5m through tools/sync_timing.py in fresh Blenders under the machine lock; <= 20 lines with PASS/MISS per cell, full log out/check/sync_timing.log, `-History` writes history lines to out/bench/; no tier runs it.
